# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010349> (melting temperature)

Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/automatce/AUTOMATCE_0010349>

  Annotations:
    rdfs:comment "Expected value datatype: xsd:float; expected unit: degC."@en,
    rdfs:label "melting temperature"@en,
